  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hearts for Ukrainians</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With the escalation of the war, by the beginning of 2023, more than 5 million internally displaced persons were officially registered in Ukraine, most of whom are women and children. Every day, a large number of IDPs in need of humanitarian, medical, psychological and social assistance arrive in the Odesa region. For more than a year, we have been continuously providing such assistance to vulnerable population, and we greatly need your support to reach more of those who need our help.</narrative>
  </description>
